{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PKPMsHD9YE1795701622.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>將軍澳有鹹水管爆裂。</p><p></p><p>爆裂位置在近將軍澳煜明苑的昭信路，涉及的是一條直徑700毫米的鹹水管，供鹹水予昭信路、常寧路及寶寧路一帶的用戶。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST-2130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262HupQ8PwkZ1795702041.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>水務署稱，下午約五時半接報，已關水掣，正全力維修水管，爭取周五晚十時前完成。該段喉管的改善工程正進行中，預計年底分階段完成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.635776+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:37:12.993020+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:20.173516+00:00","content_hash":"73c5f757c431336ba2f09aa9eea3068c42a71e046d9969e58f9c5aeba7ce203f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.635776+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}